{
  "transcriptVersion": 1,
  "id": "holders-add-to-account-preview",
  "description": "Add a key-activated licence to an account over the device-code channel (UK-42.22, WIRE-CONTRACT-V5 §12.10.1, §12.5.1). The device activates by key and the licence is floating. beginSignIn() posts the device id with the hints (loginHint, nameHint), purpose attach and licenseChoice app. The person confirms the code and signs in at the (mocked) platform IdP, server-side and unrecorded. The poll answers status choose with a grant instead of a token and the flow is spent. The SDK completes with choice {kind: keep} and the device token, which keeps this device on its licence, and the answer names the same licence and the account's subject. attach({confirm:false}) first previews the licence (status confirm, its id, tier and name; nothing is written), then attach({confirm:true}) adds the licence to the signed-in account (attached: claimed) with the same licence id.",
